        "original_id": "bb2c6bff-d538-591f-b061-78b65a7936fa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ken Leung, Scott Buck\n- Products: Inhumans, Lost, Saw\n- Organizations: ABC, Marvel Comics\n- Concepts: Inhumans, Karnak\n\nFacts:\n- Ken Leung was born on January 21, 1970, and he is an American actor.\n- Ken Leung is best known for playing Miles Straume in \"Lost\" and Detective Stephen Sing in \"Saw\".\n- Marvel's Inhumans is an American television series created for ABC by Scott Buck and based on the Marvel Comics race called the Inhumans.\n- Ken Leung portrays the Marvel Comics character Karnak, a member of the Inhumans, on the ABC television series \"Inhumans\".\n- The ABC television series \"Inhumans\" premiered in September 2017.",
